{"posts":[{"id":"fishing_p5_101","t":"One po was hit yesterday","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#101","p":5,"im":["51eca61dd8673e675424ff963b77833e2eb89db5"],"m":101},{"id":"fishing_p5_102","t":"Beautiful trade. Where did you exit?\n\ngizzo wrote: Anyway, I hit a homerun with Usdjpy. This was a PO-order with SL set as in the screenshot. I didnt wait for PA I found the last FL and price reacted as like the market was rigged?","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#102","p":5,"im":["f3f76d40993c2e067ffe4a8670e6450bdc8b9dd6"],"m":102},{"id":"fishing_p5_103","t":"Art wrote: Beautiful trade. Where did you exit?\n\ngizzo wrote: Anyway, I hit a homerun with Usdjpy. This was a PO-order with SL set as in the screenshot. I didnt wait for PA I found the last FL and price reacted as like the market was rigged?","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#103","p":5,"im":["f3f76d40993c2e067ffe4a8670e6450bdc8b9dd6","bfb389376bb9b3df2bdf7393d0f9f34ff1994d66"],"m":103},{"id":"fishing_p5_104","t":"What will they do?","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#104","p":5,"im":["bd310e99b3f61814b21ce4f55b8f49c571340061"],"m":104},{"id":"fishing_p5_105","t":"Well they wanted south!","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#105","p":5,"im":["3b40e7cbc556e38bf6e6e77f043d0961b2aaee0e","430d3f151b9838f237c8350109ac4ddeb5890dda"],"m":105},{"id":"fishing_p5_106","t":"It itches when you miss like this","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#106","p":5,"im":["9099b13427a5501dfcc284bdd43981a51e848f1a"],"m":106},{"id":"fishing_p5_107","t":"Watching NZDUSD","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#107","p":5,"im":["bf4c58b89d7ecb0b7cdb751f4e0fc2ebbf294f97"],"m":107},{"id":"fishing_p5_108","t":"Lately alot of my orders are not being filled Maybe the spread:/","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#108","p":5,"im":["8033dec7ac944ed5be71c9b2288f7fe9bfcbd6c7"],"m":108},{"id":"fishing_p5_109","t":"When you want to buy, add in the price you want to buy + spread. When you want to sell, use the price you want to sell (without needing to plus spread) Because the chart we are seeing in metatrader is bid price (the price which will be used when you want to sell) and the buying price (Ask Price) is the price we see in chart + spread\n\nAsk price could be turn on in metatrader.","a":"gristar","d":"","n":"#109","p":5,"im":[],"m":109},{"id":"fishing_p5_110","t":"gristar wrote: When you want to buy, add in the price you want to buy + spread. When you want to sell, use the price you want to sell (without needing to plus spread) Because the chart we are seeing in metatrader is bid price (the price which will be used when you want to sell) and the buying price (Ask Price) is the price we see in chart + spread\n\nAsk price could be turn on in metatrader.\n\nYes mate, It reached the level in a bad time at the day when the spread was wider:/","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#110","p":5,"im":[],"m":110},{"id":"fishing_p5_111","t":"Lately ive been struggling with finding the elephants. For some days Ive just heard them in the distance, rumbling. I try to look but there were so many trees in the way! Finally after some week I found the herd Ive looked for and they led me to fresh water.","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#111","p":5,"im":["5a5ed4c3ad68de925ea2666979a40dc3c1c5dbbf"],"m":111},{"id":"fishing_p5_112","t":"I fill all the bottles I have","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#112","p":5,"im":["7125e6143c46286b60e5797a5833ce5842b21ffa"],"m":112},{"id":"fishing_p5_113","t":"I'm a newbie so don't mind my stupid questions Is this FTB buy trade? I'm not sure if flag need to engulf SR to the left to be considered valid for FTB... anyway i found 2 other possible SR break-flag-FTB scenarios on the same chart... Are those valid setups? Why? Why not?\n\nI marked 2 SR lines and 2 flags just below your setup","a":"TheLastNail","d":"","n":"#113","p":5,"im":["a38f30cee150f65aadc07925fc93b1470c26b42e"],"m":113},{"id":"fishing_p5_114","t":"Im all over UJ and NU","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#114","p":5,"im":["8ee417367a4d07c5e3ad71309bad56b7eccbc4cc"],"m":114},{"id":"fishing_p5_115","t":"NU","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#115","p":5,"im":["9f87931